      "content": "i know people say that but it doesn't change the reality of it. i see the light going out of their eyes because of me. it's like i'm just a parasite consuming their happiness. if i wasn't here... if i just wasn't a factor in their lives at all... they could actually breathe again. they could finally be happy.",
